# The system libraries bmcd links are not optional here: it pulls in libusb
# (rockusb), OpenSSL (actix-web's openssl feature) and libudev (evdev,
# serialport). Upstream's CI installed only libusb and got away with it
# because the runner image happened to carry the rest -- a workstation
# usually does not.
eval "$(devbox generate direnv --print-envrc)"
